              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "38:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu kodi jofonjirok pere jobino Kapernaum, jocoki misolo ma Ot pa Were jobino bongi Petero to jopenjo go ni, “Jafonji mewin culo misolo ma Ot pa Were?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero odwoko ni, “Go culo.” Munyo Petero odonjo i ot, Yesu ama open luwo malo ni, “Simon, iparo nedi? Kerin ma piny jocoko tonton kosa misolo kwoŋ jokune? Kwoŋ ji pajo wegi kosa kwoŋ jowiloka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero odwoko ni, “Kwoŋ jowiloka.” Ana Yesu, “Am'omiyo, dwoŋ mere ni ji ma piny no jonitie i siem, jokicul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wakimiti ramo cuny jome, am'omiyo kidhi i wakawaka ibol'iye siraget; kwany rec m'inoyway marapena, aka i dhoke ibino nwaŋ'iye pesa ma feza ma roman kodi win culo misolo ma Ot pa Were; kwany iculi jo misolo mawan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
